<title>USA: Breitung Twp SD, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Breitung Twp SD, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc. said it won $3.500 million of Breitung Twp SD, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.39 percent.</p>
</text>
